id: FMA:5022
name: Muscle organ
is_a: FMA:67498 ! Organ
property_value: fma:definition "Nonparenchymatous organ that primarily consists of skeletal muscle tissue aggregated into macroscopic fasciculi by connective tissue; together with other muscles, it constitutes the muscular system. Examples: biceps, diaphragm, masseter, right third external intercostal muscle, external oblique, levator ani, serratus anterior." xsd:string
